5. Audio & Acoustic Engineering — Full‑Wave Models

5.1 Microphone Array Placement Optimization

High‑resolution head‑and‑torso BEM model used to simulate acoustic transfer functions from mouth to candidate mic positions. Optimisation objective:

\max_{\{\mathbf{p}_i\}} \sum_k w_k \cdot \text{DI}(f_k, \mathbf{p}_1\ldots\mathbf{p}_8)

subject to temple volume constraints. Final geometry yields DI > 6 dB over 300 Hz–4 kHz (validated on KEMAR).

5.2 Open‑Ear Speaker Leakage Simulation

Acoustic ray‑tracing + FEM of speaker outlet near ear. Far‑field leakage at 1 m computed < 38 dBA for speech (65 dBA at ear). Directivity index verified both in simulation and anechoic chamber.

