9. On‑Device SLM & Cloud Routing Algorithm

9.1 SLM Benchmarking

Benchmarks on MMLU‑style factual QA:

· On‑device 1B model: accuracy 62 % (vs. 82 % for GPT‑5o cloud).
· Latency/energy/quality trade‑off: most simple queries (weather, timers) handled locally with high confidence.

9.2 Adaptive Routing Cost Function

Decision every query:

\text{route} = \arg\min_{r\in\{\text{edge},\text{cloud}\}} \left[ w_1\cdot L_r + w_2\cdot P_{\text{energy},r} + w_3\cdot (1 - \text{Conf}_r) + w_4\cdot \mathbb{I}_{\text{battery}<20\%}\cdot \text{Penalty}_r \right]

where $L_r$ is latency, $P_{\text{energy}}$ energy cost, Conf model confidence, $w_i$ weights tuned via A/B testing.
Implementation: lightweight decision tree on NPU, < 1 ms.

