At 30 °C ambient, allowable ΔT = 13 °C (43 °C skin limit). Sustained power limit becomes 13 / 30 = 0.433 W (430 mW). Firmware enforces a 520 mW ceiling when walking (wind cooling, R_th ~22 K/W) and 430 mW when stationary.

